      "notes": [
        "All 4 acceptance criteria confirmed at code review level. Implementation is architecturally sound: sentinel detection is O(1) string inclusion, badge DOM updates are bounded and correct, the router null-guard pattern is consistent with the rest of the module. No blocking issues. Two documentation-forward items flagged: (1) module-level JSDoc should document the new credential-error display subsystem including the page-load limitation, (2) CSS section comment could group credential badge variables/rules for discoverability. Both are medium/low priority — Documentation agent should address both before marking WP-010 complete."
